WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.833
Experiments use MIMIC-three,

00:00:01.913 --> 00:00:07.844
an intensive-care database of anonymised laboratory
tests for over thirty-eight thousand

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:11.670
patients at Beth Israel Deaconess between 2001 and 2012.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:18.091
Restricting to those surviving the first
twenty-four hours leaves a cohort of 30,834 patients.

00:00:18.171 --> 00:00:24.717
Models predict in-hospital survival from the
embedding at the last observation in that first day,

00:00:24.797 --> 00:00:29.840
compared by time-dependent concordance index and
Brier score at one, seven,

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.070
and fourteen days.
